Kriti Nutrients Ltdhas informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 05/11/2026 ,inter alia, to consider and approve the following businesses along with other routine businesses:
1. Approval of the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the quarter and half year ended 30th September, 2026;
2. To take on record the Limited Review Report by the Auditors for the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the quarter and half year ended 30th September, 2026;
3. Approval of the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Statement of Assets and Liabilities for the half year ended on 30th September, 2026;
4. Approval of the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Statement of Cash Flow for the half year ended on 30thSeptember, 2026; and
5. Any Other general business as may be transacted by the Board.
